Intelligent automation of your estates taxes. Tax rate will be as high as possible while still allowing satisfaction to recover at max recovery up to a configurable target satisfaction percent.

[h1]Usage:[/h1]
In the balance tab of the economy panel you can use the plus and minus buttons to adjust the target satisfaction equilibrium. Normal click is 1% change, control click is 5%, alt click is 10% and shift click pushes it all the way to 0% or 100%.

Clicking the new diamond box will toggle enabling/disabling SmartTaxes for each estate. This way you can adjust the tax rate yourself for an estate if desired.

I don't think it's a problem to have the built-in automation on but it's best to turn it off.

[h1]Mod Compatibility:[/h1]
Now compatible with the Research Spending Mechanic mod https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3619537967. Load SmartTaxes after the Research Spending Mechanic mod.

As for other mods, this one changes gui/economy_lateralview.gui and should be compatible with any mods that don't change that file.
